{"title":"Data Scientist Roadmap","role":"Data Scientist","summary":"A Data Scientist uses statistics, programming, machine learning, experimentation, and business/domain knowledge to extract insights and build predictive systems from data.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Course":"CSE - Artificial Intelligence & Data Science (AI&DS)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Data Scientist uses statistics, programming, machine learning, experimentation, and business/domain knowledge to extract insights and build predictive systems from data."},{"type":"p","text":"The role typically involves:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data collection and preparation"},{"text":"Exploratory data analysis"},{"text":"Statistical modeling"},{"text":"Machine learning"},{"text":"Feature engineering"},{"text":"Predictive modeling"},{"text":"Experimentation and A/B testing"},{"text":"Data visualization"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Model evaluation"},{"text":"Business problem solving"},{"text":"Communicating analytical findings"}]},{"type":"p","text":"CSE-AI&DS provides a strong foundation because it combines computer science + mathematics + statistics + AI/ML + data engineering fundamentals."},{"type":"p","text":"A modern Data Scientist should not focus only on model building. The strongest profile can take a problem from raw data → analysis → model → validation → deployment/decision → business impact."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build programming, statistics, SQL, data analysis and machine-learning fundamentals; enter as Data Analyst, Junior Data Scientist, ML Analyst or Associate Data Scientist."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Progress toward Data Scientist, Senior Data Scientist, ML Scientist or Applied Scientist roles."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Lead ML/data-science projects, experimentation programs or analytics teams; progress toward Staff/Lead Data Scientist or ML Lead."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move toward Principal Data Scientist, Data Science Manager, AI/ML Architect, Head of Data Science or advanced research leadership."}]]}]},{"heading":"Year 1 — Programming, Mathematics & Statistics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The first year should build a strong quantitative and programming foundation."},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Basic Java/C++"},{"text":"Data structures"},{"text":"Algorithms"},{"text":"Object-oriented programming"},{"text":"Git/GitHub"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mathematics"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Calculus"},{"text":"Linear algebra"},{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Discrete mathematics"},{"text":"Optimization fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Python ecosystem"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"matplotlib"},{"text":"Jupyter"},{"text":"basic SciPy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"First analytical projects"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Student performance analysis"},{"text":"Sales-data analysis"},{"text":"Customer dataset exploration"},{"text":"Basic statistical analysis"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Data Analytics & Machine Learning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The second year should develop strong data-analysis and classical ML skills."},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"Filtering"},{"text":"Aggregation"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"JOINs"},{"text":"Subqueries"},{"text":"CTEs"},{"text":"Window functions"},{"text":"Views"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Missing-value handling"},{"text":"Outlier detection"},{"text":"Feature creation"},{"text":"Exploratory data analysis"},{"text":"Correlation analysis"},{"text":"Statistical distributions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Machine learning"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"h","text":"Supervised learning"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Linear regression"},{"text":"Logistic regression"},{"text":"Decision trees"},{"text":"Random forests"},{"text":"Gradient boosting"},{"text":"k-NN"},{"text":"SVM"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Unsupervised learning"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"K-means"},{"text":"Hierarchical clustering"},{"text":"PCA"},{"text":"Anomaly detection"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Evaluation"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Train/validation/test splits"},{"text":"Cross-validation"},{"text":"Overfitting"},{"text":"Underfitting"},{"text":"Bias-variance trade-off"},{"text":"Data leakage"},{"text":"Class imbalance"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Advanced Data Science","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The third year should focus on building models that solve more realistic problems."},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced ML"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XGBoost/gradient boosting"},{"text":"Ensemble methods"},{"text":"Feature selection"},{"text":"Hyperparameter optimization"},{"text":"Model calibration"},{"text":"Imbalanced classification"},{"text":"Explainable AI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Time series"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Trend"},{"text":"Seasonality"},{"text":"Autocorrelation"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"ARIMA-family methods"},{"text":"Exponential smoothing"},{"text":"ML-based forecasting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Natural Language Processing"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Text preprocessing"},{"text":"TF-IDF"},{"text":"Embeddings"},{"text":"Text classification"},{"text":"Transformer architecture"},{"text":"LLM fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Deep Learning"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Neural networks"},{"text":"Backpropagation"},{"text":"CNNs"},{"text":"RNN concepts"},{"text":"Transformers"},{"text":"Transfer learning"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PyTorch"},{"text":"TensorFlow/Keras"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 4 — Production Data Science","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The final year should bridge the gap between notebook-based ML and production systems."},{"type":"h","text":"Data engineering fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ETL/ELT"},{"text":"Data pipelines"},{"text":"Data warehouses"},{"text":"Data lakes"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Batch vs streaming"},{"text":"Data quality"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MLOps"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Model versioning"},{"text":"Experiment tracking"},{"text":"Model serving"},{"text":"Monitoring"},{"text":"Retraining"},{"text":"CI/CD fundamentals"},{"text":"Docker"},{"text":"Cloud deployment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Deployment"},{"type":"p","text":"Build familiarity with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FastAPI"},{"text":"Docker"},{"text":"GitHub Actions"},{"text":"AWS/Azure/GCP fundamentals"},{"text":"MLflow"},{"text":"Cloud storage"},{"text":"Managed databases"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Production workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Problem","Data Collection","Data Validation","EDA","Feature Engineering","Model Development","Model Evaluation","Deployment","Monitoring","Retraining / Improvement"]}]},{"heading":"Core Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill Area","Target Level"],"rows":[[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Linear Algebra"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Machine Learning"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Data Analysis"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Data Visualization"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Feature Engineering"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Model Evaluation"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Experimental Design"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Time-Series Analysis"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Deep Learning"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"NLP"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Data Engineering"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"MLOps"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Git"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Linux"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Docker"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Cloud"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Power BI/Tableau"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Business Understanding"},{"text":"Advanced"}]]}]},{"heading":"Data Science Problem-Solving Framework","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Data Scientist should begin with the problem, not the algorithm."},{"type":"flow","items":["Business / Research Problem","Define Objective & KPI","Identify Data Sources","Collect / Validate Data","Exploratory Data Analysis","Statistical Analysis","Feature Engineering","Model Selection","Training & Validation","Business / Scientific Interpretation","Deployment / Decision","Monitor Performance"]},{"type":"p","text":"A technically sophisticated model is not necessarily useful if it does not solve the original problem."}]},{"heading":"Recommended Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Customer Churn Prediction"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a system that predicts which customers are likely to leave."},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EDA"},{"text":"Feature engineering"},{"text":"Classification"},{"text":"Model comparison"},{"text":"Precision/recall"},{"text":"Explainability"},{"text":"Business recommendations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Demand Forecasting"},{"type":"p","text":"Forecast product demand using historical data."},{"type":"flow","items":["Historical Data","Data Cleaning","Trend / Seasonality","Feature Engineering","Forecasting Model","Prediction","Inventory / Business Decision"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Recommendation System"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a recommendation engine using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Collaborative filtering"},{"text":"Content-based methods"},{"text":"Embeddings"},{"text":"Evaluate recommendation quality rather than only displaying recommendations."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — NLP / LLM Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Build an application such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Document classification"},{"text":"Semantic search"},{"text":"Question answering"},{"text":"RAG system"},{"text":"Customer-support assistant"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Embeddings"},{"text":"Retrieval"},{"text":"Prompting"},{"text":"Evaluation"},{"text":"Hallucination risks"},{"text":"Context management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — End-to-End ML System"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Data","SQL / Data Pipeline","Python","ML Model","FastAPI","Docker","Cloud Deployment","Monitoring"]},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates much more than a standalone Jupyter notebook."}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target internships in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Science"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Scientist Intern"},{"text":"Data Analytics Intern"},{"text":"ML Intern"},{"text":"Decision Science Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI/ML"},{"text":"Product analytics"},{"text":"Recommendation systems"},{"text":"Search"},{"text":"Fraud detection"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Marketing analytics"},{"text":"Customer analytics"},{"text":"Financial analytics"},{"text":"Operations analytics"},{"text":"Risk analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Machine learning"},{"text":"NLP"},{"text":"Computer vision"},{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"Applied statistics"},{"text":"A strong internship should involve real datasets and measurable analytical/modeling work, not just dashboard creation."}]}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Possible roles include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Scientist"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Junior Data Scientist"},{"text":"Associate Data Scientist"},{"text":"Data Analyst"},{"text":"Product Data Analyst"},{"text":"Machine Learning Engineer"},{"text":"ML Analyst"},{"text":"Applied Scientist"},{"text":"Decision Scientist"},{"text":"Business Intelligence Analyst"},{"text":"Quantitative Analyst"},{"text":"Research Analyst"},{"text":"AI Engineer"},{"text":"Data Science Consultant"},{"text":"Job titles differ significantly between organizations."}]}]},{"heading":"Employer Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Employer Type","Most Valuable Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"ML + Python + SQL + Algorithms"}],[{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Recommendation + Experimentation + Forecasting"}],[{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"Statistics + Risk + ML + SQL"}],[{"text":"Healthcare"},{"text":"Statistics + ML + Domain Knowledge"}],[{"text":"Consulting"},{"text":"Analytics + Communication + Business Understanding"}],[{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Predictive Maintenance + Time Series"}],[{"text":"Retail"},{"text":"Customer Analytics + Forecasting"}],[{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Experimentation + Attribution + Analytics"}],[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Mathematics + ML + Scientific Computing"}],[{"text":"Startups"},{"text":"End-to-End ML + Data Engineering + Deployment"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For Data Science, projects, internships and demonstrable technical depth generally matter more than certificates."},{"type":"h","text":"High-value learning"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Machine Learning"},{"text":"Deep Learning"},{"text":"Data Visualization"},{"text":"Cloud"},{"text":"MLOps"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful tools"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Git/GitHub"},{"text":"Docker"},{"text":"MLflow"},{"text":"FastAPI"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Tableau"},{"text":"PyTorch"},{"text":"scikit-learn"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud"},{"type":"p","text":"Gain practical familiarity with at least one:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AWS"},{"text":"Azure"},{"text":"Google Cloud"}]}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"M.Tech / M.E."},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Artificial Intelligence"},{"text":"Data Science"},{"text":"Computer Science"},{"text":"Machine Learning"},{"text":"AI & Data Analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"M.S."},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Science"},{"text":"Computer Science"},{"text":"Machine Learning"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Artificial Intelligence"},{"text":"Computational Science"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA"},{"type":"p","text":"For a business/leadership transition:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Strategy"},{"text":"Product Management"},{"text":"General Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"PhD"},{"type":"p","text":"For research-heavy careers:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Machine Learning"},{"text":"Artificial Intelligence"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Computer Science"},{"text":"Computational Science"},{"text":"Operations Research"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"1. Product Data Science"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User behavior"},{"text":"Product metrics"},{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"Recommendation"},{"text":"Product decisions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Machine Learning"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Predictive models"},{"text":"Classification"},{"text":"Ranking"},{"text":"Optimization"},{"text":"Production ML"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. NLP / Generative AI"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"LLMs"},{"text":"RAG"},{"text":"NLP"},{"text":"Evaluation"},{"text":"AI applications"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Computer Vision"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Image classification"},{"text":"Object detection"},{"text":"Image segmentation"},{"text":"Video analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Decision Science"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Causal inference"},{"text":"Experimentation"},{"text":"Optimization"},{"text":"Business decisions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. AI Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Novel algorithms"},{"text":"Deep learning"},{"text":"Foundation models"},{"text":"Reinforcement learning"},{"text":"Scientific research"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"B.Tech / B.E."},{"type":"flow","items":["CSE - AI & Data Science","Data Analyst / Junior Data Scientist","Data Scientist","Senior Data Scientist","Lead / Staff Data Scientist","Principal Data Scientist","Data Science Manager / AI Lead","Head of Data Science / AI","Director / VP of Data & AI"]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical route"},{"type":"flow","items":["Data Scientist","Senior Data Scientist","Staff Data Scientist","Principal Data Scientist","Distinguished Scientist"]}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Data Science is rapidly evolving beyond traditional machine learning."},{"type":"p","text":"Important areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"Large language models"},{"text":"Multimodal AI"},{"text":"AI agents"},{"text":"Retrieval-augmented generation"},{"text":"Synthetic data"},{"text":"Automated ML"},{"text":"Causal machine learning"},{"text":"Federated learning"},{"text":"Privacy-preserving ML"},{"text":"Graph machine learning"},{"text":"Foundation models"},{"text":"Scientific AI"},{"text":"Real-time ML"},{"text":"Edge AI"},{"text":"AI-assisted data analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Modern Data Scientist workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Raw Data","Data Engineering","Analytics","Statistical Reasoning","ML / AI","Experimentation","Deployment","Monitoring","Business Impact"]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Linear Algebra"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Machine Learning"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Data Analysis"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Data Visualization"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Experimentation"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Time Series"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Deep Learning"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"NLP / Generative AI"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Data Engineering"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"MLOps"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Cloud"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Business Understanding"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should ideally be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Write production-quality Python for data work"},{"text":"Write advanced SQL queries"},{"text":"Clean and analyze messy datasets"},{"text":"Perform statistical analysis"},{"text":"Conduct exploratory data analysis"},{"text":"Build and evaluate ML models"},{"text":"Prevent data leakage"},{"text":"Handle imbalanced datasets"},{"text":"Perform feature engineering"},{"text":"Explain model results"},{"text":"Build forecasting models"},{"text":"Conduct basic experiments/A-B tests"},{"text":"Work with deep learning fundamentals"},{"text":"Understand LLM/RAG concepts"},{"text":"Build data pipelines at a basic level"},{"text":"Deploy an ML model through an API"},{"text":"Use Git and Docker"},{"text":"Work with one major cloud platform"},{"text":"Communicate technical findings to non-technical stakeholders"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal portfolio"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"2 strong SQL/data-analysis projects"},{"text":"2 classical ML projects"},{"text":"1 time-series project"},{"text":"1 NLP/LLM project"},{"text":"1 recommendation or forecasting project"},{"text":"1 end-to-end deployed ML project"},{"text":"1 Power BI/Tableau dashboard"},{"text":"1 research-oriented project"},{"text":"At least 1 relevant internship"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"For B.Tech/B.E. CSE - Artificial Intelligence & Data Science → Data Scientist, the strongest positioning is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Python","SQL","Statistics","Machine Learning","Data Analysis","Experimentation","Deep Learning/GenAI","Data Engineering","MLOps","Business Understanding"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The student should avoid becoming only a “model builder.” The stronger 2026+ Data Scientist profile can understand the complete lifecycle: define the problem → obtain and validate data → analyze → model → evaluate → deploy → monitor → communicate business impact."},{"type":"p","text":"For long-term specialization, Product Data Science, ML/AI, Generative AI, Decision Science, and AI research provide distinct pathways. A student aiming for highly research-oriented Data Scientist/Applied Scientist roles should prioritize mathematics, statistics, research experience and postgraduate study, while an industry-oriented candidate should emphasize SQL, production ML, cloud, experimentation and end-to-end projects."}]}]}